  ,
  "rationale": "The `hasCEO` relationship is defined from Company to Person, so we match that direction. First we find all Persons who have ever been CEO of a Company whose name contains \"GitHub\". Then we count all distinct Companies that each of those Persons has held the CEO position for."
}

